    "description": "Carved Meerschaum Pipe Lot\nHorse and Sultan Head Designs\nVintage, Set of 2 With Cases\nThis lot features two intricately hand-carved pipes crafted from white meerschaum, a porous mineral prized for its heat resistance and ability to color over time with use. One pipe showcases a detailed horse head, while the other depicts a bearded figure in the traditional Sultan style. These pieces represent a classic era of pipe artistry, characterized by fine decorative carving and custom-fitted protective cases.\nPipe 1: Detailed horse head bowl carving with yellow amber-colored stem and orange-lined case\nPipe 2: Sultan head bowl carving with orange marbled amber-style stem and white-lined case\nMaterial: Hand-carved white meerschaum with synthetic resin stems\nProtective hard-shell cases included for both pieces, featuring hinged metal clasps\nCondition:\nBowls show surface darkening and charring consistent with previous use. Carvings remain sharp with no significant chips or missing details. Stems are intact with light tooth marks near the mouthpieces. Cases show exterior scuffing and interior fabric wear; clasps are functional. One case includes a small paper fragment.\nThank you for all of your support!",
